{"sections":[{"slug":"稳定无穷范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"稳定无穷范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"稳定范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">以下的范畴均默认为</span> $(\\infty,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">稳定范畴是类似于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Sp","text":"$\\mathsf{Sp}$"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">具有一对互逆的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">和</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" ("},{"Local":{"url":"/纬悬","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纬悬</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">函子的范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">稳定范畴</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下条件的范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有有限极限和有限余极限</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">具有零对象</span> $0$, <span lang=\"zh\">以及态射的纤维</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">余纤维</span>;</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的拉回方块等同于推出方块</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维列</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余纤维列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余纤维列</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纬悬","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纬悬</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $\\Sigma\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $\\Omega\\colon \\mathcal C\\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成一对互逆的范畴等价</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">记号</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对稳定范畴的对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及整数</span> $n$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span>\n$$\r\n    X[n] = \\Sigma^n X,\r\n$$\n$$\r\n    X[-n] = \\Omega^n X.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">稳定化</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">具有有限极限的范畴都有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">谱充实</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">稳定范畴自然地</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于稳定范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的对象</span> $X,Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">映射谱</span> $\\underline{\\operatorname{Hom}}(X,Y)$ <span lang=\"zh\">可如下定义</span>:\n$$\r\n\\underline{\\operatorname{Hom}}(X,Y)_n = \\operatorname{Hom}(X,Y[n]).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">同伦范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">稳定范畴的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/三角范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">三角范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">例如两个对象</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的直和</span> $X\\oplus Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">既为范畴论和</span> $X+Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">又为范畴论积</span> $X\\times Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">两者同构</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">对偶对称性</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">稳定范畴的对偶仍是稳定范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴不可能是稳定范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">除非它是平凡的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">等价于终范畴</span> $1$).</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴是最基本的稳定范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞Grpd","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal A$, <span lang=\"zh\">其上的有界链复形范畴</span> $\\operatorname{Ch}^{\\text{b}}(\\mathcal A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成稳定无穷范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/K-理论","text":"K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/t-结构","text":"t-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}